@startuml
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome false

' === STANDARD LIGHT BLUE THEME ===
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #0284C7
    ActorBorderColor #0284C7
    ActorBackgroundColor #38BDF8
    ActorFontColor #0F172A
    
    ParticipantBorderColor #0284C7
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #BAE6FD
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    
    LifeLineBorderColor #0284C7
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #E0F2FE
    
    BoxBorderColor #0284C7
    BoxBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
    BoxFontColor #0284C7
}
' =================================

actor "Job Seeker / Guest" as User
participant "React Web Client\n(SPA)" as Client
participant "Laravel API Gateway\n(JobPostingController)" as API
database "MySQL Database\n(job_postings)" as DB

User -> Client: 1. Input search keywords & select filter facets (Location, Salary, Type)
activate Client

Client -> API: 2. GET /api/jobs?keyword=...&department=...&workplace=...
activate API

API -> DB: 3. Query active job listings (WHERE status='active' AND criteria MATCH)
activate DB
DB --> API: 4. Return matching records & company relationship data
deactivate DB

API --> Client: 5. HTTP 200 OK (JSON array of job vacancy cards & total count)
deactivate API

Client --> User: 6. Dynamically render job vacancy cards & company badges
deactivate Client
@enduml
